  "details": "There is currently what I feel is a loophole with the vote kick system where a user can block other people to avoid being vote kicked. Searching the name of the user that blocked you and kicking via search causes the conditions to vote to kick not met prompt every time. I have seen problematic users and predators evade the vote kick system entirely in public instances just by blocking people.\n\nThere is also the issue where a majority of the time, vote kick vote notifications do not appear on screen when they're called, resulting in a lot of users missing the chance to vote.",
